      en: ["The plain sits at an elevation of approximately 150 to 200 meters.", "It is watered by the San Marino stream (Torrente San Marino).", "Gualdicciolo is the primary industrial zone of the Republic.", "The border with Italy runs directly along the plain's northern edge.", "Alluvial soils make the area geologically unique within the country.", "Significant ceramic and metallurgical companies are located here."],
